      "isAutoRefreshDisabled": false,
      "markdown": "# CRS Status List — Business Metrics\nA plain-language view of status list service activity: how many statuses are issued and revoked (and by whom), how much traffic the public endpoints receive, how effective CloudFront caching is, and how lists are being renewed and published.\n\n**Sections:** Issuance & Revocation · Public Endpoint Traffic · CloudFront Caching · List Lifecycle · End-to-End Timing · Daily Completion Rate.\n\n> **PLACEHOLDERS TO REPLACE BEFORE USE:** `CLOUDFRONT_DISTRIBUTION_ID`, and any tile marked _NEEDS LOG-BASED METRIC_ (per-client / per-signing-key breakdowns are not emitted as CloudWatch/EMF metrics today). See the section notes."
    },
    {
      "name": "Markdown",
      "tileType": "MARKDOWN",
      "configured": true,
      "bounds": {
        "top": 152,
        "left": 0,
        "width": 2280,
        "height": 38
      },
      "tileFilter": {},
      "isAutoRefreshDisabled": false,
      "markdown": "## Issuance & Revocation\nTotals come from API Gateway request counts on `/issue` and `/revoke` (API `crs-backend-status-api`). Per-client / token-vs-bitstring splits are **not** available as CloudWatch metrics today — they would require a log-based metric."
    },
    {
